{
  "doc": "stages/filters.geomdistance.rst: 'Normal distance mode causes any points *within* the given polygon to have a distance of 0.' -- with ring left at its default the polygon is solid, so a polygon covering the whole lattice footprint puts every one of the 1000 points at distance 0.",
